  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx5 - 10x4 + 10x3 - 10x2 + 10x -1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSubstituting x = 9 in x5 - 10x4 + 10x3 - 10x2 + 10x - 1, \n\n9⁵- 10(9)4 + 10(9)3 - 10(9)2 + 10(9) -1 = 8\n\n**∴ If x = 9, then the value of x5 - 10x4 + 10x3 - 10x2 + 10x -1 is 8.**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] __Alternate Method__**\n\nGiven:\n\nx5 - 10x4 + 10x3 - 10x2 + 10x -1\n\nCalculation:\n\nSubstituting x = 9 in x5 - 10x4 + 10x3 - 10x2 + 10x - 1, \n\n95- 10(9)4 + 10(9)3 - 10(9)2 + 10(9) -1 \n\nWrite 10 as (9 +1).\n\nThen, 95- (9+1)(9)4 + (9 +1)(9)3 - (9+1)(9)2 + (9+1)(9) -1\n\n⇒ 95- 95 - 94 + 94 + 93 - 93 - 92 + 92 +9 -1 = 8\n\n∴ If x = 9, then the value of x5 - 10x4 + 10x3 - 10x2 + 10x -1 is 8.",
